 &lt;BR&gt; 
5. The Shareholder’s of the Company vide their resolution dated July 7, 2025 has approved the issuance of bonus shares in the proportion of one bonus equity share for every two existing equity shares. On July 21, 2025 upon issuance of such Bonus Equity Shares, the paid capital of the Company stands increased to INR 1,055 crore having 10,554,442,601 number of equity shares of INR 1 each. In accordance with the requirement of Ind AS 33- Earning per share, the basic and diluted Earnings per share have been adjusted for all the periods presented to reflect the impact of bonus issue. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
